{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Expand and Preserve Your Territory with Immortal Tiles</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/512baa717ba345e1d779885d57d819eb.poster.avif?t=1759693335\" width=1170 height=368 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/512baa717ba345e1d779885d57d819eb.webm?t=1759693335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/512baa717ba345e1d779885d57d819eb.mp4?t=1759693335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this ever-changing world, land is not just for building\u2014it\u2019s for survival. Immortal Tiles allow you to expand your domain, creating space for new structures while shielding your territory from the relentless decay of the world. Without them, nature reclaims the land, erasing what once stood. Secure your future, build strategically, and ensure that your legacy endures in a world that refuses to stay the same.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Rich System of Skills, Jobs, and Items</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your characters in diverse skills and professions, unlocking rare equipment and mastering job-based abilities to gain an edge in combat and exploration. Carefully develop your party to adapt to the challenges ahead, whether through raw strength, tactical finesse, or specialized support roles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Additionally, the Zodiac system and unique character traits influence each character\u2019s stats and performance, shaping their strengths, weaknesses, and synergy with others. A well-balanced team, with traits and zodiac signs that complement each other, can mean the difference between survival and defeat in this ever-evolving world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A Living Economy &amp; Crafting System</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Trade, build, craft, and manage resources in an economy that fluctuates based on traders' affinities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this ever-changing RPG world, time waits for no one. Adapt, strategize, and leave your mark\u2014before the world moves on without you.<br><br><strong>Your can to work on other tasks while expand and Preserve Your Territory</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/8fffb61c6e5d3e0c2821d194315a8f47.poster.avif?t=1759693335\" width=1170 height=388 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/8fffb61c6e5d3e0c2821d194315a8f47.webm?t=1759693335\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/extras/8fffb61c6e5d3e0c2821d194315a8f47.mp4?t=1759693335\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547960?t=1759693335","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3547960?t=1759693335","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/25f3f3d6f85a1f85a8d1d13ef53c0df34a3c7159/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759693335","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3547960/25f3f3d6f85a1f85a8d1d13ef53c0df34a3c7159/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1759693335","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Steam Leaderboards","id":25},{"descriptio